# SHA-256 of each RyzenAdj build nullmoth-ryzen-power.sh may install, one per line, lowercase hex, optionally followed by
# a note. Nothing else is installed.
# RyzenAdj v0.19.0, commit ea71739b4a3e1a0a624dfd1c9c268a31cb2a4182 (FlyGoat/RyzenAdj, LGPL-3.0) with NullMoth's macOS OS
# layer (ryzenadj-macos/osdep_macos.c), built by ryzenadj-macos/build.sh with Xcode on x86_64, macOS 15 target, signed ad hoc
# with the entitlement the NMSMN kext requires of its caller; two builds gave the same bytes. It needs the NMSMN kext and
# boot argument nmsmn=1.
